---
---
<section class="relative py-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-am-dark to-am-blue/30 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-20 right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-am-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-am-blue-mid/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-grid-lg pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Pulsing nodes -->
  {[[20,15],[30,20],[25,25],[35,15]].map(([t, l], i) => (
    <div class="absolute w-2 h-2 bg-am-accent rounded-full blur-sm animate-pulse-dot pointer-events-none"
      style={`top:${t}%;left:${l}%;animation-delay:${i*0.5}s`}></div>
  ))}

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 reveal">
      Detrás de cada experiencia hay un equipo que la hace posible
    </h2>

    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal" data-delay="0.1">
      En Areamovil creemos que los mejores productos digitales nacen cuando distintas miradas trabajan en sincronía.
      Nuestro equipo convierte investigación, organización y diseño en experiencias claras, útiles y listas para evolucionar.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center reveal" data-delay="0.2">
      <a href="/proyectos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-am-yellow text-am-dark hover:bg-am-yellow/90 font-semibold px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-am-yellow/20 transition-all duration-300 group">
        Ver proyectos
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-white text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
        Volver al Home
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Summary tags -->
    <div class="mt-20 inline-block reveal" data-delay="0.4">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-am-blue/30 to-am-dark/30 backdrop-blur-sm border border-am-accent/20 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6 flex-wrap justify-center">
          {[
            { label: 'Gestión',      color: '#014D94' },
            { label: 'Diseño UX/UI', color: '#0A84FF' },
            { label: 'Colaboración', color: '#FFC501' },
            { label: 'Implementación', color: '#014D94' },
          ].map((tag, i) => (
            <>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style={`background:${tag.color}`}></div>
                <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">{tag.label}</span>
              </div>
              {i < 3 && <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-am-accent/50 to-am-blue-mid/50 hidden sm:block"></div>}
            </>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
